Goal-setting!

17
00:01:38.122 --> 00:01:43.540
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:44.740
Balance!

19
00:01:45.684 --> 00:01:54.567
Did you know? Research suggests a new habit takes about two months to form on average — and missing one day does not ruin your progress!

20
00:01:54.617 --> 00:01:56.500
